  "body": "Pins `actions/create-github-app-token` to the commit behind v2.2.2 (`fee1f7d`) instead of the mutable `v2` tag. This workflow feeds the org Dependabot secret `AUTOMERGE_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` (infra-bootstrap-github-app private key) into the action — a retagged/backdoored release is the most direct exfil path for it, so the tag must not be mutable.\n\nDependabot's `github-actions` ecosystem understands SHA pins with a trailing version comment and will keep proposing pinned bumps.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
